.Dd September 3, 2026
.Dt VDOTS-UPDATE 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm vdots-update
.Nd update Neovim plugins, prune, test
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl -commit | Fl c
.Op Fl -interactive | Fl i
.Op Fl -clean-only
.Op Fl -no-test
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
updates plugins via
.Ic vim.pack ,
prunes packages that are on disk but no longer in the
.Ic vim.pack.add
manifest, runs the headless regression suite, and shows the
.Pa nvim-pack-lock.json
diff. Editor-only LSP servers are managed separately by Mason
.Pf ( Pa lua/editor/mason.lua ) ;
CLI / CI tools come from the zdots Brewfile.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--interactive, -i"
.It Fl -commit , Fl c
Auto-commit the lockfile change when the post-update test run passes.
.It Fl -interactive , Fl i
Open an interactive changelog-review buffer in
.Xr nvim 1
before committing.
.It Fl -clean-only
Only prune unmanaged / inactive plugins from disk; do not update.
.It Fl -no-test
Skip the regression suite after updating.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr vdots 1 ,
.Xr vdots-ctl 1 ,
.Xr vdots-doctor 1
